title: MeshCentral C2 Beacon to Azurenetfiles Domain
id: f1e870d8-c9f2-42f2-b586-4fe6cc41ddd9
status: experimental
description: >
    Detects connections to azurenetfiles.net, the MeshCentral
    command-and-control host (wss://azurenetfiles.net:443/agent.ashx)
    Mandiant published for the Oracle PeopleSoft Environment
    Management (PSEMHUB) exploitation campaign attributed to
    ShinyHunters, the group alleged to have breached FBI systems via a
    PeopleSoft zero-day. Staging hosts 142.11.200.186 through
    142.11.200.190 accompany this C2.
references:
    - https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/shinyhunters-targets-education-sector-oracle-exploit
    - https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/shinyhunters-claims-fbi-hack-data-theft-in-peoplesoft-zero-day-breach/
author: Tia N. List
date: 2026/09/25
tags:
    - attack.t1102
    - attack.t1190
logsource:
    category: network_connection
    product: windows
detection:
    selection_c2:
        DestinationHostname|endswith: 'azurenetfiles.net'
    condition: selection_c2
falsepositives:
    - Legitimate file or cloud-storage traffic to a shared hosting domain (rare; correlate with PeopleSoft host context)
level: high
